<td id="A6.T8.2.1.6.8" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><span id="A6.T8.2.1.6.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">74.3</span><math id="A6.T8.m38" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo mathsize="0.800em">±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A6.T8.2.1.6.8.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3.3</span></td>
<td id="A6.T8.2.1.6.9" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><span id="A6.T8.2.1.6.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">72.4</span><math id="A6.T8.m39" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo mathsize="0.800em">±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A6.T8.2.1.6.9.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2.7</span></td>
<td id="A6.T8.2.1.6.10" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><span id="A6.T8.2.1.6.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">94.4</span><math id="A6.T8.m40" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo mathsize="0.800em">±</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pm</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A6.T8.2.1.6.10.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2.4</span></td></tr>
</table>
</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:80%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span><span id="A6.T8.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Results of Temperature Ablation Study</span> on GSM8K Test Set for Llama 3B Instruct Trained with Fuzzy Model on GSM8K Train. <em id="A6.T8.9" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Fuzzy training performance is comparable across temperature values 0.1-0.0001</em>.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A6.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Table <a href="#A6.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ F.3 Temperature ‣ Appendix F Ablations ‣ Soft Tokens, Hard Truths" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, we report test performance on GSM8K test set for Llama 3b Instruct trained with the fuzzy RLOO, varying the temperature, <math id="A6.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>. Further, in Figure <a href="#A6.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ Appendix F Ablations ‣ Soft Tokens, Hard Truths" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>, we report the greedy validation performance on GSM8K train set. We observe that our algorithm appears robust to temperatures between 0.1 and 0.0001.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
