<section id="A7.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">G.3 </span>Entropy Analysis</h3>

<div id="A7.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Figures
<a href="#A7.F16" title="Figure 16 ‣ G.3 Entropy Analysis ‣ Appendix G Supplementary Results ‣ Soft Tokens, Hard Truths" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a>,
<a href="#A7.F17" title="Figure 17 ‣ G.3 Entropy Analysis ‣ Appendix G Supplementary Results ‣ Soft Tokens, Hard Truths" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>,
<a href="#A7.F18" title="Figure 18 ‣ G.3 Entropy Analysis ‣ Appendix G Supplementary Results ‣ Soft Tokens, Hard Truths" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>, <a href="#A7.F19" title="Figure 19 ‣ G.3 Entropy Analysis ‣ Appendix G Supplementary Results ‣ Soft Tokens, Hard Truths" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">19</span></a>, we report the CoT entropy on each model and training dataset combination across each training method (none, hard, fuzzy and soft) and evaluation metric (hard greedy, hard sample, fuzzy greedy, hard greedy, soft greedy, soft sample). For each token position <math id="A7.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, CoT entropy is the mean token-distribution entropy across all test generations, computed only on non-pad tokens. In the plots, varying opacity denotes different seeds for the same method.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A7.F16" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.19170v1/qwen_3b_math_math500_entropy.png" id="A7.F16.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:452/305;" width="452" height="305" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 16: </span><span id="A7.F16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">CoT Entropy on MATH500 of Qwen 3b Trained on MATH Train</span></figcaption>
